@author "Claude (Anthropic)"
; A tuck: the top layer's corner goes between the two layers of a folded
; square. The diagram refuses it.

paper square

fold (map .a onto .d)
.m = free on --bc from .b at 1/2
.n = free on --ab from .b at 1/2
.p = free on --ab from .a at 1/4
fold (through .m .n) (moving .b) (up to .b) (under .p)
